1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,768
Is your sign the one

2
00:00:01,818 --> 00:00:04,586
that should take it easy today?

3
00:00:04,636 --> 00:00:06,132
Today, 25 October

4
00:00:06,182 --> 00:00:09,950
is a slower day for the Year of the Tiger.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,853
Today is a Monkey day, and the Tiger

6
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:15,918
sits opposite it in the zodiac circle.

7
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:18,176
Some days, things just don't

8
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:19,950
go the way we planned.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,617
And that's okay.

10
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,533
Everyone has days like this.

11
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:27,554
A quiet day is not a bad day.

12
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,950
It is a day to breathe.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,495
Impatience may flare

14
00:00:34,545 --> 00:00:39,950
when others move slowly.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,027
Tension could rise over small things

16
00:00:43,077 --> 00:00:44,736
so choose kind words

17
00:00:44,786 --> 00:00:47,300
and let minor annoyances pass.

18
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,950
And lean on a friend you trust.

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,450
Hold off on impulse buying

20
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,758
or sudden price changes.

21
00:00:54,808 --> 00:00:58,027
At work, take small, careful steps

22
00:00:58,077 --> 00:00:59,950
one thing at a time.

23
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,712
Slow is still moving forward.

24
00:01:02,762 --> 00:01:05,950
Every quiet day makes you stronger

25
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,569
and brighter days

26
00:01:07,619 --> 00:01:09,950
are already on their way.

27
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,145
My tip: take a short walk or a quiet

28
00:01:12,195 --> 00:01:14,523
break before any important conversation

29
00:01:14,573 --> 00:01:15,682
and keep your plans

30
00:01:15,732 --> 00:01:17,328
for today light and simple.

31
00:01:17,378 --> 00:01:18,609
Tomorrow is a new day

32
00:01:18,659 --> 00:01:19,950
and it could be yours.
